              "key": "owner",
              "label": "Data owner",
              "units": 0.7
            }
          ],
          "rows": 6
        },
        {
          "key": "data_integrity_checks",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Data completeness and traceability checks",
          "items": [
            "Final inspection uses the current order and acceptance-plan revisions",
            "Offered quantity remains traceable to work order, lot, and serial range",
            "Production and special-process evidence is complete before release",
            "Actual final results support the stated acceptance status",
            "Workmanship criteria and visual evidence are applied consistently",
            "Labels, markings, packaging, and certificates match the product",
            "Rework and concessions receive required reinspection or approval",
            "Accepted, rejected, rework, and held quantities reconcile",
            "Shipment holds are visible in both physical and system status",
            "Customer source inspection is complete when required"
          ]
        },
